{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39765","headline":"省试一一吹竽 · 黄滔","name":"省试一一吹竽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"齐竽今历试，真僞不难知。\n欲使声声别，须令个个吹。\n後先无错杂，能否立参差。\n次第教单进，宫商乃异宜。\n凡音皆窜迹，至艺始呈奇。\n以此论文学，终凭一一窥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}